# Minecraft Version(s): 26.3
## Changes:
- Golden & Turkey Chickens now lay their own eggs

## Fixes:
- White Black Wolf variant not spawning in Taiga biomes
- Creaking Wolf variant not dropping Resin Clumps
- Wandering Traders only leashing one of their two Wandering Cows
- Only one chicken being converted per cycle when renaming chickens to/from "Benny" or when multiple Chicken Jockeys spawn at once